{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04294","headline":"奉和过梁王宅即目应制 · 武三思","name":"奉和过梁王宅即目应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岩居多水石，野宅满风烟。\n本谓开三径，俄欣降九天。\n穿林移步辇，拂岸转行旃。\n凤竹初垂箨，龟河未吐莲。\n愿持山作寿，恒用劫爲年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武三思","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04294.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04294","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}